::narrative: arc3_storm_calculus
@title: Arc 3 - Storm Calculus
::scene: charting
@title: Charting The Tempest
!sfx: scribble, thunder_murmur
!music: tension_under
 !action: Electrostatic glyphs crawl over translucent charts.
 [[ NAVIGATOR SEY ]] 
 "Vectors won't stabilize; the storm well is fractalizing."
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Approximate. Chaos still yields corridors—find one."
::end: {{ charting }}
::scene: breach
@title: Hull Breach
!sfx: metal_groan, alarm_chime
!music: crisis_theme
!vfx: water_spray
 !action: Rivets ping free into spiraling salt fog.
 [[ NAVIGATOR SEY ]]
 "Bulkhead twelve failing!" 
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Seal compartments nine through eleven—buy us ten breaths."
::end: {{ breach }}
::end: {{ arc3_storm_calculus }}
